                                                "sense_id": "747c104b-d0de-3c14-862a-d661d5450bba",
                                                "text": "We ran three red lights on the way to the hospital."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "225ebdac-9dd5-4e61-8f56-a3f896bf2515",
                                                "sense_id": "747c104b-d0de-3c14-862a-d661d5450bba",
                                                "text": "Paddington [the GWR HQ] saw the red light, however, and the extension to Nantgarw was withdrawn on the G.W.R. agreeing \"to lay down the narrow gauge [actually standard gauge as compared to broad gauge] from Didcot over the whole of their system in South Wales.\""
